    "updated_at": "2017-04-17T21:31:39Z",
    "body": "New proposed commit message:\r\n\r\n```\r\nFix an algorithm that was treating null as a module script\r\n\r\nIn particular, the \"uninstantiated inclusive descendant module scripts\"\r\nwas not properly skipping null entries in the module map (which\r\nrepresent failed fetches). Only module script entries should be returned\r\nand processed by subsequent steps of the calling algorithm.\r\n```",
